 "brief_summary": "We randomize individuals with impaired glucose tolerance to one of three arms for degree of physical activity: 1. Continue with your current life style; 2. Ordinary life activities for increased physical activity; 3. Scheduled group activities for changed behavior. The overall aim is to focus on change of physical activity and to keep other life style activities more or less unchanged (diet, smoking, etc) and the effect on metabolic variables.",
